<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="737.627" endTime="742.853">
<Sync time="737.627"/>
Tikihtowa komekat, *este**, mochi:wa kowke:span, kowke:spamekat t'to:ka:ytia, ne:, ¿ke:niwki n' ixiwyo?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="742.853" endTime="828.548">
<Sync time="742.853"/>
Ixiwyo, *este**, nojó:n tikiliah, ne:,
<Sync time="747.871"/>
